# Firmware secrets - templates are kept next to them as *.example.
# Written before the firmware networking work starts so that an accidental
# `git add -A` cannot pick a real credential up.
# secrets.ini is retired (its -D flag path cannot carry a space, see
# platformio.ini) but stays ignored in case one is still lying around.
secrets.ini
src/Secrets.h
src/ServerCaCert.h